BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rhodes-fanes-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-fanes-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Metamorfosi Sotiros\, Fanes
LOCATION:Fanes\, Rhodes\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Fanes\, on the west coast between Kalavarda and Soroni\, celebrates the Transfiguration with a village panigiri on the evenings of 5 and 6 August: liturgy at the Sotiras church\, then a glendi on the square with local bands\, souvlaki and wine. Neighbouring Maritsa does its own 'Sotiria' the same days\, so you can hop between them. Kiotari in the south also feasts the Saviour on 5-6 August.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#fanes-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-fanes
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#fanes-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-fanes
END:VEVENT
