BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rhodes-kremasti-panigiri-of-panagia-kremasti-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270823
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia\, Kremasti
LOCATION:Kremasti\, Rhodes\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Dormition feast at the big Panagia church of Kremasti\, near the airport\, turns into a nine-day fair (roughly 14-23 August) with a huge street market\, funfair rides\, food stalls and evening concerts on the square. The religious high point is the vespers and procession on the evening of the 14th. Traffic on the airport road is heavy those nights\; come by bus from Rhodes town or park well outside the village.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#kremasti-panigiri-of-panagia-kremasti
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#kremasti-panigiri-of-panagia-kremasti
END:VEVENT
